        "Weak alert escalation and incomplete listing and follow-up of contacts around confirmed cases.",
        "Points of entry and control remain under-operationalised: Tshopo has 7 of 20 sites active (35%), Haut-Uele 10 of 38 priority sites (26.3%), and Ituri 1 of 11 strategic sites running without interruption.",
        "Screening refusals recorded at 86 in Haut-Uele and 38 in Tshopo, attributed to disease denial, fear of contamination from handwashing water, and fear of being admitted to a treatment centre.",
