        "Weak infection-prevention implementation: 63 of 115 same-day confirmed cases had their households decontaminated in Ituri, reporting completeness limited to 6 of 12 health zones in Nord-Kivu and 9 of 12 in Ituri, and scorecards averaging 36.5% in Nord-Kivu, 45.2% at Polyclinique Rekapi and 12.9% at the Makiso-Kisangani military pavilion.",
        "Referral capacity short: 3 ambulances out of service in Ituri, no ambulance in 7 Nord-Kivu health zones and no treatment centre in 4, and 10 further ambulances needed in Haut-Uele; no standard treatment centre in any of the 6 affected Haut-Uele zones and the Wamba transit isolation centre over capacity.",
